description "Bespin Wing Guard

Quick, versatile security units equipped for disabling criminals and quick takedowns.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
- Relby-K23 Blaster Pistol (2)
-- Mandalorian Pistol
-- 35% More Damage/FP Drain
-- 20% Slower RoF
-- Mag Reload
- DH-17 Police Rifle (1)
-- Based On Blaster Rifle
-- 30% Faster RoF
-- 20% Less Damage
-- 5% Faster Velocity
-- Mag Reload, 5 Shot Clip
- Shock Baton (Cyan Style Saber)
-- Stuns on hit
-- Low Damage (50)
-- No Blaster/Saber Defense
-- No Blaster Deflect
-- No Saber Training
- Smoke Grenade (1)
-- Frag Grenade
-- No Damage, Smoke Screen On Det

^8Attributes:
- Reinforcements (4)
- Assemble (3)
- Strength (1)
- Anti MT (1)
- Tracking Beacon
- Ammo (3)
- Stamina (1)

^3Abilities:
- Dodge (1) ^3[CS1]
- Sprint (1) ^3[CS2]
- Quickthrow (1) ^3[CS3]
- Grappling Hook (1) ^3[CS4]"